From: Jashandeepstudent <Jashandeepstudent@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 14:43:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix Hey Acazen wake word + double-press Power voice launch
 (v2.11.0)

- WakeWordService: open-vocabulary Vosk recognition (old constrained grammar
  could never match 'acazen' since it is not in the model vocabulary) plus
  fuzzy phonetic matching (bounded Levenshtein over word windows)
- WakeLaunchActivity: dedicated wake page - turns screen on, shows over
  keyguard, launches app with ACTION_WAKE_WORD even when app is closed
- DoublePressPowerService + VoiceCommandActivity: Safari-style double-press
  Power button -> lock-screen listening UI -> live transcript -> auto-send
- MainActivity JS bridge: isDoublePressSupported/On, enable/disableDoublePress
- Manifest/theme/resources for new service and activities
- versionCode 13, versionName 2.11.0
